      "title": "Running a First Test",
      "sourceHash": "07b2f8930f841a19491775381426072c929a03bb67b8be4c002e1eaef7a0caaa",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 5.47,
          "en": "So automated testing is a nice feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.47,
          "end": 7.28,
          "en": "How does it work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.28,
          "end": 10.07,
          "en": "As I mentioned, attached to the previous lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.07,
          "end": 12.56,
          "en": "you found this starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.56,
          "end": 14.81,
          "en": "which is a standard react project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.81,
          "end": 18.333,
          "en": "which I did create with create react app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.39,
          "end": 22.96,
          "en": "Now I didn't really change the component code too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.96,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "I just cleaned up the index JS file a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 30.82,
          "en": "and I did not delete the app test JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 33.89,
          "en": "which we did not use up to this point in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.89,
          "end": 36.06,
          "en": "and the setup test JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.06,
          "end": 38.453,
          "en": "because we will need those files now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.83,
          "end": 42.72,
          "en": "Now set up tests JS, as the name implies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 45.06,
          "en": "just does some setup work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.06,
          "end": 48.77,
          "en": "and we don't need to do anything else in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.77,
          "end": 52.36,
          "en": "But the app test JS file is quite interesting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.36,
          "end": 56.95,
          "en": "This is a file that contains some testing code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.95,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "and it is there out of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 60.43,
          "en": "Later in this module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.43,
          "end": 64.45,
          "en": "we will also write our own tests from scratch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.45,
          "end": 68.47,
          "en": "This is a file which is there to test this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.47,
          "end": 71.34,
          "en": "because the convention is to name your testing files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.34,
          "end": 73.1,
          "en": "like your component files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.1,
          "end": 75.65,
          "en": "just with the word test in the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.65,
          "end": 80.65,
          "en": "So dot test dot JS as an extension to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.76,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "And in this app test JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 86.35,
          "en": "We have this test function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.35,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "which we execute here, which takes two arguments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 93.41,
          "en": "The first argument is a description of the test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.41,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "This is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.64,
          "end": 98.31,
          "en": "It helps you identify this test in the testing output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.31,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "which we'll see in a couple of minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.77000000000001,
          "end": 102.27000000000001,
          "en": "And it's especially helpful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.27000000000001,
          "end": 105.65,
          "en": "if you have an app with more than one test, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.65,
          "end": 108.14,
          "en": "The second argument is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.14,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "an anonymous function, which is the point here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 113.543,
          "en": "which contains the actual test and code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.41,
          "end": 117.03999999999999,
          "en": "So that's the code which will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.03999999999999,
          "end": 119.75,
          "en": "once we run our test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.75,
          "end": 122.33,
          "en": "And in there, we do a couple of things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.33,
          "end": 124.97,
          "en": "which we don't fully understand yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.97,
          "end": 127.12,
          "en": "but we will soon understand it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.12,
          "end": 130.85,
          "en": "We rendered the app component in the end with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.85,
          "end": 134.63,
          "en": "of that render function imported from the testing library.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.63,
          "end": 136.64,
          "en": "So from that third party package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.6,
          "end": 142.6,
          "en": "then we get hold of some element on that virtual screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.69,
          "end": 146.37,
          "en": "So to say, so in that simulated browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.37,
          "end": 150.52,
          "en": "So to say, into which this app is rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.52,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "we get hold of some element in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 154.49,
          "en": "and we identify an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.49,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "by the text that is rendered inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 159.59,
          "en": "Here we are looking for the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.59,
          "end": 163.51,
          "en": "learn react in a case insensitive way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.51,
          "end": 167,
          "en": "This is our regular expression in case you're wondering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167,
          "end": 168.54,
          "en": "And then we just check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 172.16,
          "en": "if that element actually is in the document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.16,
          "end": 176.68,
          "en": "So if it exists in the document. And this test will fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.68,
          "end": 180.72,
          "en": "if this element is not found and it will succeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.72,
          "end": 181.773,
          "en": "if it is found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.8,
          "end": 185.56,
          "en": "And in app JS, we do have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.56,
          "end": 188.89,
          "en": "this, content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.89,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "and we do have this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 193.37,
          "en": "learn react text in this anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.37,
          "end": 194.5,
          "en": "And so if we look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.5,
          "end": 199.49,
          "en": "for an element with a text of learn react case insensitive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.49,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "so casing does not matter, then this test should succeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 206.093,
          "en": "because such an element clearly exist here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.53,
          "end": 209.93,
          "en": "But that's all nice and theory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.93,
          "end": 212.48,
          "en": "How do we run this test?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.48,
          "end": 214.15,
          "en": "For this, we got a script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.15,
          "end": 218.177,
          "en": "just as we got a script for running the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.177,
          "end": 219.893,
          "en": "We run the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.893,
          "end": 223.05,
          "en": "So that we as a human can preview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.05,
          "end": 225.02,
          "en": "our app and interact with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.02,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "We run the automated tests to see if those work and for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 232.97,
          "en": "in packaged dot Json, we have this test script here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 237.86,
          "en": "and we can run this test script from inside the terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.86,
          "end": 240.25,
          "en": "And here I'm using the terminal integrated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.25,
          "end": 244.99,
          "en": "into visual studio code by running NPM test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.99,
          "end": 249.23,
          "en": "So just as NPM start, started the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 249.23,
          "end": 253.04,
          "en": "NPM tests, will run our automated tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.04,
          "end": 255.86,
          "en": "And here, if I now hit enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.86,
          "end": 258.87,
          "en": "this will start up the testing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.87,
          "end": 262.8,
          "en": "And actually, it does not run the tests right now.",
