        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.32,
          "end": 267.57,
          "en": "to run all the tests it finds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.57,
          "end": 269.46,
          "en": "and it will automatically look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.46,
          "end": 273.62,
          "en": "for files that end with dot test dot JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.62,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "and then run all the tests that are defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 278.72,
          "en": "in there with that test function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.72,
          "end": 281.02,
          "en": "So in this case, this one test, which we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 281.89,
          "end": 283.78,
          "en": "So if I now run, 8 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.78,
          "end": 287.99,
          "en": "If I press 8, you see it executed my tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.99,
          "end": 290.253,
          "en": "And then we get this test output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.14,
          "end": 295.93,
          "en": "We see that it ran one test in total.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.93,
          "end": 298.33,
          "en": "And that one test passed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.33,
          "end": 299.90999999999997,
          "en": "I'll come back to the difference between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 302.28,
          "en": "tests suites, and tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.28,
          "end": 303.23,
          "en": "A little bit later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.23,
          "end": 306.88,
          "en": "here we see that it ran one test overall,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 306.88,
          "end": 308.85,
          "en": "and that test passed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.85,
          "end": 311.29,
          "en": "And here we then see all the tests also,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.29,
          "end": 312.98,
          "en": "all the tests that passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 312.98,
          "end": 316.32,
          "en": "in this case with the green check mark next to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 316.32,
          "end": 319.43,
          "en": "And here we see that description text again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.43,
          "end": 320.85,
          "en": "which we entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 320.85,
          "end": 324.99,
          "en": "So that is what helps us identify which test succeeded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.99,
          "end": 325.823,
          "en": "or failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 326.96,
          "end": 329,
          "en": "And for example, if I now go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329,
          "end": 331.23,
          "en": "to app JS here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.23,
          "end": 335.6,
          "en": "and I remove this text, learn react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 335.6,
          "end": 338.57,
          "en": "and I instead say, learn more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.57,
          "end": 342.06,
          "en": "You see if I save us the tests automatically rerun",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 342.06,
          "end": 343.36,
          "en": "because by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.36,
          "end": 346.65,
          "en": "it watches your files and reruns the tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 346.65,
          "end": 348.7,
          "en": "Whenever you save changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.7,
          "end": 351.943,
          "en": "And now you see that we get a failed test here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 352.976,
          "end": 355.34000000000003,
          "en": "And if I scroll up, we get more information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.34000000000003,
          "end": 358.48,
          "en": "We see that this test failed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 358.48,
          "end": 362.34,
          "en": "we see that by that red cross here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.34,
          "end": 365.92,
          "en": "And we also get an explanation of why it failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 365.92,
          "end": 369.853,
          "en": "Unable to find an element with the text, learn react.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 370.93,
          "end": 374.5,
          "en": "Then we get an output off the actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 374.5,
          "end": 378.6,
          "en": "which had rendered where it tried to find that text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 378.6,
          "end": 380.79,
          "en": "and where it failed to do so.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 380.79,
          "end": 383.96,
          "en": "Of course, that is the content of app JS here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 383.96,
          "end": 385.59,
          "en": "Then we see the testing code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 385.59,
          "end": 389.77,
          "en": "and the line that failed in this case get by text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 389.77,
          "end": 391.94,
          "en": "That's the line that failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 391.94,
          "end": 394.69,
          "en": "And that is why desk test failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 394.69,
          "end": 399.69,
          "en": "And now as a developer, we could either adjust our test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 399.72,
          "end": 401.88,
          "en": "If we want to have learned more here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 401.88,
          "end": 404.18,
          "en": "or go back to learn react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 404.18,
          "end": 407.55,
          "en": "to make sure that this test passes again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 407.55,
          "end": 410.1,
          "en": "And of course that's a rather dumb example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 410.1,
          "end": 412.05,
          "en": "It's just a basic example.",
